# NOTICE

This repository contains an unofficial compatibility patch for a separately
installed copy of Anthropic's Claude Desktop. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by Anthropic.

No Anthropic proprietary binaries or source files are included in this
repository. In particular, the repository does not contain `claude.exe`,
`app.asar`, `ion-dist.asar`, or extracted contents of those archives.

Users must obtain their own licensed copy of Claude Desktop and use their own
Claude Code subscription. The build scripts operate on files supplied by the
user and produce a local, modified copy for that user.

Short code-anchor strings in the patch scripts are necessary for
interoperability with a specific Claude Desktop version. They are not intended
to reproduce or redistribute Anthropic source code.

